<%- include('partials/header') %>
      <div class="authorization-page-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="authorization-page-kicker">COOKIE CREDENTIALS</p>
          <h1>授权管理</h1>
          <p class="authorization-page-summary">管理各平台的 Netscape Cookie 文件，每个平台最多保存一份。</p>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#authorization-modal" data-authorization-create>新增授权</button>
      </div>

      <div id="authorization-page-error" class="alert alert-danger" role="alert" hidden></div>

      <div class="alert alert-warning authorization-integration-warning" role="alert">
        <strong>使用范围</strong>
        <p class="mb-0">频道可选择同平台授权用于首次同步、手动检查和定时检查；直接下载、媒体下载及未选择授权的频道不会使用 Cookie。</p>
      </div>

      <section class="authorization-list-card" aria-labelledby="authorization-list-title">
        <div class="authorization-section-heading">
          <h2 id="authorization-list-title">已配置授权</h2>
          <p>编辑会完整替换原文件；删除会立即移除文件且无法恢复。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="table-responsive">
          <table class="table align-middle authorization-table">
            <thead>
              <tr><th scope="col">平台</th><th scope="col">状态</th><th scope="col">更新时间</th><th scope="col">操作</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="authorization-list"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="authorization-safety-card" aria-labelledby="authorization-safety-title">
        <h2 id="authorization-safety-title">安全获取与导出说明</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>只在可信设备上登录目标平台，并使用可信工具从当前登录会话导出 Netscape 格式的 <code>cookies.txt</code>。</li>
          <li>新增授权时选择平台并上传文件；编辑授权时重新上传完整文件。系统不会读取浏览器资料目录、代替你登录、转换其他授权格式或验证远端有效性。</li>
          <li>Cookie 等同账号登录凭据。不要通过聊天、工单、截图、日志或公开文件传递原文；不再需要或怀疑泄露时，请删除授权或重新导出后替换。</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>“已配置”仅表示文件已保存且格式正确，不代表登录态当前有效。</strong></p>
      </section>

      <div class="modal fade" id="authorization-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="authorization-modal-title" aria-hidden="true" data-bs-backdrop="static">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
          <div class="modal-content">
            <form id="authorization-form" class="authorization-modal-form">
              <div class="modal-header">
                <h2 class="modal-title h5" id="authorization-modal-title">新增授权</h2>
                <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="关闭"></button>
              </div>
              <div class="modal-body">
                <div>
                  <label class="form-label" for="authorization-platform">平台</label>
                  <select class="form-select" id="authorization-platform" name="platform" required></select>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="form-label" for="authorization-file">Netscape Cookie 文件</label>
                  <input class="form-control" id="authorization-file" name="cookieFile" type="file" accept=".txt,text/plain" required>
                </div>
                <div class="alert alert-danger mb-0" data-form-error role="alert" hidden></div>
              </div>
              <div class="modal-footer">
                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">取消</button>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" data-authorization-submit>新增授权</button>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <script type="module" src="/public/authorizations.js"></script>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
